            <ArticleTitle>Plasma adrenomedullin levels in the coronary circulation in vasospastic angina pectoris.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>656-8, A10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This study evaluated the role of adrenomedullin in patients with vasospastic angina pectoris. Adrenomedullin may be involved in regulating a basal tone of the coronary artery in these patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
